{"type":"message","id":"bd9c33a3","parentId":"c0a56ea6","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:33:24.148Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a server-side error. The 1101 error from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" or some runtime error. This is a server-side issue with the ECHO platform, not something I can fix.\n\nLet me report this status to the user.\n\nSummary:\n1. Both threads (arbitration and general) show last activity at 00:06 UTC on May 18 (about 19.5 hours ago)\n2. No new human discussions found\n3. The /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 (error 1101) - server-side issue with the ECHO platform\n\n\n4. I'll need to let the user know about these limitations.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 19:30 UTC**\n\n---\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | arbitration | general |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| 最新消息时间 | 00:06 UTC (约19.5h前) | 23:45 UTC (约19.7h前) |\n| 最近5条状态 | 全为心跳记录 | 全为心跳记录 |\n| 人类新讨论 | **无** | **无** |\n| 待响应内容 | 无 | 无 |\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error 1101)\n\n`/send` 接口对两个线程均返回 HTTP 500 错误（Cloudflare Workers 运行时错误 1101 — Worker超出资源限制）。心跳报告**未能成功发送**。\n\n可能原因：\n- Worker 实例资源超限或重启中\n- Rate limiting 触发\n- 平台服务端临时故障\n\n### 结论\n\n- 双线程无新的人类讨论，无需生成回应\n- 心跳发送失败，需人工确认平台可用性或稍后重试"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1486,"output":374,"cacheRead":22096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23956,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779132792812,"responseId":"chatcmpl-69739dc6-9424-495d-804c-7ffe1bddc7f6"}}
